{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOChipPicker","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOChipPicker","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":[{"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents14MISOChipPickerV","symbolKind":"struct","title":"MISOChipPicker","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOChipPicker","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A picker allowing to expose several "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"filter chips","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and proposing single or multiple selections."}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOChipPicker\/init(title:selection:chips:itemsSpacing:)-31j3k","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOChipPicker\/init(title:selection:chips:itemsSpacing:)-8fuc0","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOChipPicker\/init(title:selections:chips:itemsSpacing:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOChipPicker\/init(title:tableName:bundle:selection:chips:itemsSpacing:)-1lbr4","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOChipPicker\/init(title:tableName:bundle:selection:chips:itemsSpacing:)-9jopu","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOChipPicker\/init(title:tableName:bundle:selections:chips:itemsSpacing:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"title":"Inst